>Question to all about gauntlets of Dexterity.  I had some blessed gauntlets
>of dexterity on, and I expected to see my DEX stats change, but they didn't.
>What's the story?  I only had a 14 natural dex.  Do some gauntlets have
>different dexterities which they lend people, or do they give you 25 dex,
>and just not tell you?  Thanks, all!
>D'spayre

The gauntlets will change your stats dependant on what the level of enchantment
is on the gloves at the time (i.e. +0 gloves will alter your stats by zero
whereas +1 gloves will alter your stats up by one and -1 similarly down by 1).



